SUMMARY:12+ Night Walk with Nonie at Oak Tree Nature Park
LOCATION:Oak Tree Nature Park\, Doolittle Boulevard and Hollywood Boulevard
 \, Mary Esther\, FL 32569
DESCRIPTION:Friday 11/20 · 4:30 PM to 6:00 PM\n\nNonie of Nonie's Animal E
 ncounters leads an evening walk through Oak Tree Nature Park for the Mary 
 Esther Library\, looking for foxes\, owls\, flying squirrels and bats. Thi
 s walk is the library's tween\, teen and adult session\, open to ages 12 a
 nd up. The group starts at the library at 4:30 PM and crosses the street t
 o the park at the crosswalk\, and the walk lasts about an hour and a half.
 \n\nPrice: No published price\n\nDetails: https://coastaleventures.com/eve
 nts/ev-mary-esther-teen-night-walk-nonie-1120.html
