 rations\, birdwatching and giveaways. Wild Birds Unlimited will be there w
 ith advice on bird feeding. Anyone can walk in\, and the society lists it 
 as free.\n\nPrice: Free\n\nDetails: https://coastaleventures.com/events/ev
