LOCATION:Historic Blakeley State Park\, 34745 State Highway 225\, Spanish F
 ort\, AL 36527
DESCRIPTION:Saturday 11/21 · 11:00 AM\n\nA local search and rescue team te
 aches children basic survival steps for the day they get lost outdoors. Vi
 sitors watch demonstrations of how search dogs are trained and how they fi
 nd a missing person\, then meet the dogs. The program runs one hour and co
 sts nothing beyond regular park admission.\n\nPrice: from $3\n\nDetails: h
 ttps://coastaleventures.com/events/ev-blakeley-search-rescue-kids-1121.htm
