 reek excursion\, Live Oak Landing\, off Alabama State Highway 225\, Stockt
 on\, AL
DESCRIPTION:Saturday 12/5 · 9:00 AM\n\nA boat takes visitors to the Bottle
  Creek site\, which holds 18 earthen mounds built centuries ago by Native 
 Americans. The site is reachable only by boat and was once one of the larg
 est communities in the Southeast. The trip runs from 9:00 AM to 12:30 PM a
 nd includes about a half mile of walking.\n\nPrice: from $35\n\nDetails: h
 ttps://coastaleventures.com/events/ev-blakeley-bottle-creek-mounds-1205.ht
